  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Livelihoods and Access to Markets Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s goal is to improve household incomes and the quality of life in rural
Meghalaya. This will be achieved by means of the development objective of
expanded and sustainable livelihood opportunities adapted to the hill environment
and to the effects of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
